  "name": "gorilla",
  "_about": "a silverback mountain gorilla SCULPTED on its rig (2026-11-05, gen: scratchpad sc/prim/gen/gorilla.py, written in its standing pose): the game's first ape. Massive -- a barrel chest under a hump of shoulder, the back falling to a narrow rump; arms longer than its legs, KNUCKLE-WALKING on fingers curled under (bare pads on the ground), short bowed legs on an ape's foot with the great toe set apart; the head low between the shoulders, a domed crown rising to the sagittal crest (a rust tinge on it), a heavy brow over small dark forward-facing eyes, a bare black face, broad nostrils, small ears in the hair; black hair (shag: long locks on the arms, the chest's skin bare) and the SILVER SADDLE of an old male over the back and rump (2026-11-08, ears2.py) The EARS (ears2.py): small flat shells close to the head (sharp.js `fin`), rooted along their front edge, the hollow out and forward, its fold (the helix) a band of the outer colour; the roots faired.",
